  "cil_liability": false,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The property would not be suitable for subdivision into separate units, failing to meet the minimum floor area threshold, have regard to external space standards or provide a good standard of accommodation for occupiers. Accordingly, the application is unacceptable in principle contrary to Local Plan policy SC6.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal would fail to provide an acceptable quality of accommodation and private amenity space for future occupants of the ground floor flat contrary to London Plan policy D6 and Local Plan policy SC5.",
    "Reason : 3 - Due to the inaccessibility of the bin stores and the excessive distances from the kerbside, it is considered that the proposal would fail to incorporate suitable arrangements for waste management contrary to Local Plan policy EQ7 and the council's waste and recycling guidance.",
    "Reason : 4 - Without evidence to the contrary the proposal would result in harm to highway and pedestrian safety and would fail to provide acceptable cycle storage facilities contrary to London Plan policies T4 and T5 and Local Plan policy EC2."
  ],
